OL,3,GNEWSAChemical plant starts production
OL,4,Aafter takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FStreamlined production at a chemical
OL,7,Fplant has restarted, months after its
OL,8,Fformer owners made hundreds of
OL,9,Femployees redundant.
OL,11,FThe titanium dioxide (TiO2) pigment
OL,12,Fproduction facility at Greatham, in
OL,13,FHartlepool, has reopened as newly
OL,14,Fcreated company, Tioxide Materials
OL,15,FLimited.
OL,17,FLB Group, who own the subsidiary,
OL,18,Fbought the plant from Venator Materials
OL,19,FUK after that company went into
OL,20,Fadministration last year with 270 job
OL,21,Flosses across Venator's Greatham,
OL,22,FWynyard and Birtley sites.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
