OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChemical plant starts production
OL,4,Aafter takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FTioxide said operations were being
OL,7,Fbrought back in phases, with plans to
OL,8,Fincrease production to the site's full
OL,9,Fcapacity by early 2027. Titanium
OL,10,Fdioxide is a material used in coatings,
OL,11,Fplastics and inks applications.
